  "configuration_id": "config_033",
  "reason": "The current best is config_006 (rna_only, multiprofile, scvi_n200, transformer) at 0.653 accuracy. Image-only models are very weak (0.21-0.23), so the key uncertainty is whether adding image features via fusion can complement the strong RNA signal or will dilute it. Config_033 directly extends the best RNA-only configuration by adding resnet50 image features with weighted fusion, which adaptively balances modality contributions and is safer than concat when one modality is much weaker. This isolates the effect of multimodal fusion on the proven-best RNA pipeline. If it beats 0.653, the last 2 experiments can explore ViT or other fusion variants; if it does not, we confirm RNA-only is optimal and can use remaining budget to fine-tune aggregation or encoder choices within the RNA-only space."
}

